# Basic Auth Spring Boot Application

This is a simple Spring Boot application with basic authentication.

## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- Java 11
- Maven

### Installation

1. Clone the repository:
    ```sh
    git clone https://github.com/Ishwarya-29/Springboot_product_Project.git
    ```
2. Navigate to the project directory:
    ```sh
    cd basicauth
    ```

### Configuration

Update the `application.properties` file with your desired username and password for basic authentication:

```properties
spring.security.user.name=admin
spring.security.user.password=admin@123
